# Large Raw Audio Datasets
# NOTE: 'data/' was listed here, but data/ holds SOURCE MODULES (real_dataset_loader.py,
# defence_noise_generator.py, dataset_builder.py) totalling ~160 KB and no audio at all.
# Ignoring it left the entire data pipeline out of version control, so a fresh clone could
# not run. The raw audio lives under datasets/, which is still ignored below.
datasets/
*.wav
*.flac
*.mp3

